<title>NORWAY: Saga to make Santa Fe announcement today.</title>
<headline>Saga to make Santa Fe announcement today.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saga Petroleum ASA said on Wednesday it would hold a news conference at 1000 GMT in connection with its negotiations with Kuwait Petroleum Corp over the acquisition of KP North Sea Holdings Ltd (Santa Fe).</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
